  "details": "The following strings are missing for translation:\n\n- Load More ({0}) | Seen in the \"Worlds\" section of a profile.\n\n- Manage your friendship with this user | Seen when hovering the \"Friends\" section of a user that is a friend.\n\n- Add this friend to one of your favorites groups | Seen when hovering the \"Favorite Friend\" button of the \"Friends\" section.\n\n- Remove this user from your friend list | Seen when hovering the \"Unfriend\" button of the \"Friends\" section.\n\n- Click to view: {0} | Seen when hovering the represented group next to the trust rank in the profile of a user.\n\n- Report a bug to the VRChat team | Seen when hovering the \"Report bug\" button in the \"debug\" section of the settings in the QM or MM.\n\n- You already have a pending report for that | Seen when trying to report an element that has already been reported for the same reason. \n\n- Are you sure you want to remove {0} from your friends list? | Seen when trying to remove someone from your friends list.\n\nThe following strings are unupdated, making them not translated even if approved:\n\n- Reduce Menu and Profile Decoration Animations is disabled, click to reduce menu animations | 138983 and it's \"enabled\" counterpart 138985\n\nScreens are shared for more context and appears in order.",
